node_modules
.wrangler/
app/checks/out/
.dev.vars
# The rulebooks are not ours to publish (this repository is public): a safety net for a local copy of the
# markdown (RULES.md). The rules live in the D1 database, imported from the GM's PC, never in git.
rules-src/
rules-private/

# GM pack: the generators' tables are GM-only table data; built by scripts/gm-pack.mjs, never committed.
gm-private/

# Calling cards: the faction deck's art is the book's (Tim Denee's), so the scene and its card images are built on the GM's PC
# (node tools/ambient/scenes/cards.js) and deployed from disk, never committed. See tools/ambient/README.md.
app/ambient/calling-cards.html
tools/ambient/cards/

# The theme the opening credits play is someone's recording: kept on the GM's PC (app/media/theme.mp3), deployed from disk,
# never committed.
app/media/

# The handout images (prop art, copied from the vault by `npm run gm:handouts`): inside app/media/ above, named here too so the
# intent survives a change to that line. Deployed from disk, never committed (HOSTING.md, GM.md "Handouts").
app/media/handouts/

# An episode's own opening credits (IP5.2): built from an episode file kept off the repository (campaign data; this repository is
# public) with `node tools/ambient/scenes/credits.js --episode <file.json>`, deployed from disk, never committed. The display plays it
# in place of opening-credits.html when the file is on the server. See tools/ambient/README.md.
app/ambient/episode-credits.html
